—engage in serious and visible preparations
                        that show we have a unified U.S. team as well as close allied consultation
                        and support;

—Get the focus for priority attention back on START, where we seek a ceiling on ballistic missile warheads
                        and subceilings which can form the heart of a strategic arms reduction
                        agreement;

—Give Gorbachev a direct and
                        authoritative description of your July proposal on strategic defenses, and
